2258:LOGBOOK.md-321-- ANOMALY: Round 2 removed `1u2vpc ← 2ayxqn`, which scheduled the libssh2 functional/rekey matrix **before** Gate P0 existed while the matrix scope still required a Gate-P0 provider smoke on this Mac. Restored rather than re-scoped, so no Apple-target row is weakened. Consequence: M0 engine selection (`1gjxer`) correctly lands after P0.
